  "provenance": {
    "combat_front": "Preserves supplied Orc merchant full-body pixel silhouette, lower face/jaw, arms, leather material detail, legs and boots. The hood above row 15 is replaced by exposed scalp and a jagged black mohawk. New low-level equipment, robe and minor tusk sharpening are deliberately authored whole pixels. Original desktop material colours map to a separate brighter source palette, recorded explicitly.",
    "combat_back": "Preserves merchant 48×48 body contour, legs and boots; face region replaced by true back of head and neck, shoulder blades/straps authored. Source named combat_back itself depicts a front view, so it cannot be reused unchanged.",
    "world": "New native 16×16 views matching the supplied Orc proportions, green/brown material family, crest and equipment. Directions are separately authored. Not claimed as original user PNG pixels.",
    "animations": "Subtle two-step world gait and three combat idle poses, preserving anatomy and class equipment."
  },
